      "text": "𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜 𝐀𝐝𝐯𝐢𝐬𝐨𝐫𝐲\n\nIn connection with “SHAB-E-QADAR” JAAGNE KI RAATH, in the intervening night of 16/17-03-2026, to ensure better road safety and to avert any untoward incident/road accidents, two wheelers will not be allowed on the flyovers at 1) Dr.Manmohan Singh Express Flyover (Zoo Park to Aramghar flyover), 2) Bahadurpura Flyover (Devi Bagh to Zoo Park gate no.2), 3) Chandrayangutta flyover (Entrance from Nayara Petrol pump Hashamabad to Phoolbagh DLRL) and 4) Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam Flyover (Pisalbanda to Laxma Reddy Garden Function Hall) after 10.00 p.m.,.\n\nGeneral public/commuters are requested to make note of above restrictions and co-operate with the Traffic Police.\n\nIn case of any inconvenience in commuting, please contact traffic helpline 9010203626.\n\nJt. Commissioner of Police,\nTraffic, Hyderabad.",
